WITH passage5_3 AS (

Dear Team,

As you know, we began trialling a four-day working week in the Marketing department three months ago. Provided that productivity levels remain stable over the coming quarter, we intend to extend the trial to the Sales and Customer Service teams from September. However, should output fall by more than five percent during this period, the trial will be paused and reviewed before any further rollout takes place. Employees taking part are still expected to complete their usual weekly hours, spread across four days instead of five, and any unfinished tasks should not simply be carried over without discussion with your manager. We would also ask that participants complete a short survey at the end of each month, as your feedback will directly shape whether this becomes a permanent policy. Thank you for your patience as we work through this trial.

Kind regards,
Operations Team', 'reading', 'B2', 'email')
  RETURNING id
)

WITH passage5_4 AS (

Dear Colleagues,

I am writing to inform you that, following an extensive review of our payroll arrangements, the company has decided to transition from PaySure Ltd to Meridian Payroll Services with effect from the first of next month. Although this change has been under consideration for some time, the decision was ultimately prompted by a series of processing errors that PaySure failed to resolve despite repeated requests. Employees whose bank details or tax codes have changed within the last three months are asked to submit an updated payroll form to HR by the fifteenth, since Meridian will not have access to records held solely by the previous provider. While most staff should notice no disruption to their pay dates, those who are paid via international bank transfer may experience a delay of up to five working days during the first cycle, as the new system''s international payment channels are still being tested. We appreciate your patience during this transition and will circulate a further update once the migration has been completed.

Best regards,
Finance Director', 'reading', 'C1', 'email')
  RETURNING id
)

